    "tags": ["math", "勾股定理"],
    "subject": "math",
    "stem": "直角三角形的两条直角边分别为6和8，斜边的长是？",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "10"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "14"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "12"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "√48"}
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "由勾股定理：c²=a²+b²=6²+8²=36+64=100，c=√100=10。这是经典的3-4-5勾股数的倍数。",
    "hint": "勾股定理：直角边的平方和等于斜边的平方。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
